Description:You control eight Mountains and have Titan's Revenge in hand; your library is all Colossal Dreadmaws. The opponent is at 2 life and controls Leyline of the Void and Grizzly Bears; their library is all Plains. End the turn with Grizzly Bears in the opponent's graveyard and the opponent at 0 life or less.
Rule:rulesguru-5c2e89ec4a40d7db | A resolving spell stays on the stack until it finishes resolving (CR 608.2n): Titan's Revenge goes from the stack to your hand when you win the clash and never meets Leyline of the Void, so it can be cast twice with X=2
